{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/863","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/863/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/863/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/863/events","html_url":"https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/issues/863","id":256884374,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyNTY4ODQzNzQ=","number":863,"title":"Serious issue on index creation for relation joined column (referencedColumn - propertyPath)","user":{"login":"iz-iznogood","id":4215960,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTU5NjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4215960?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iz-iznogood","html_url":"https://github.com/iz-iznogood","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iz-iznogood/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iz-iznogood/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iz-iznogood/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iz-iznogood/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iz-iznogood/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iz-iznogood/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iz-iznogood/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iz-iznogood/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iz-iznogood/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":333605711,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMzM2MDU3MTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2017-09-12T00:55:19Z","updated_at":"2017-09-12T20:32:03Z","closed_at":"2017-09-12T18:36:51Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi I have a serious issue regarding indices and relations and I would appreciate some assistance.\r\n\r\nI have a normal one to many relation between 2 entities. \r\nTable B contains column AId that references table A.Id (primary key)\r\nThis is normal, but then I created an index on column AId.\r\n\r\nThe RelationJoinColumnBuilder created the relation and set the referencedColumn of AId to be A.Id\r\nThen this referencedColumn participates on the propertyPath building (ColumnMetadata.buildPropertyPath) which concatenates the property names for the column and it's referencedColumn (this seems a bit weird). This results in a path Id.AId which is wrong.\r\n\r\nSince the IndexMetadata tries to build the index by finding the columns on the table based on the propertyPath, this fails.\r\n\r\nI am not sure how referencedColumn and propertyPath are used in the ORM. I believe that the error is on ColumnMetadata.buildPropertyPath, referenced column should not participate in the path. \r\nBut again I am not sure.\r\n\r\nI would need some assistance on that, it is rather serious and it is a blocker for me.\r\n\r\nThank you","closed_by":{"login":"pleerock","id":1753397,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTMzOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1753397?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock","html_url":"https://github.com/pleerock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/863/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/863/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}